# The sprite pipeline's output. All generated by `vite.assetpack.ts`: nothing
# here is authored, and `pnpm build` or `pnpm dev` recreates all of it.
#
# Upstream this lives on `main`, which has no pipeline, deliberately: a checkout
# that has been on `with/pixi-js` leaves these behind, and without this they
# show up as untracked and fail `format:check` on a generated manifest - a false
# red in a gate, which is what teaches people to stop reading gates.
#
# `dist` is this repo's own extra entry and stays. It is assetpack's DEFAULT
# output, unused here, listed so that a stale one cannot be committed again if a
# version ever changes the default back.
static/assets
dist
.assetpack
src/lib/manifest.json
